{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/mon-reve-by-credo-credo-investment-fze-downtowndubai","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":220,"crm_id":"2928","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Mon Reve by Credo","slug":"mon-reve-by-credo-credo-investment-fze-downtowndubai","display_address":"Downtown Dubai","building_type":["apartment","duplex"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"Credo Investments FZE","price":2813058,"display_price":"2.813M","lattitude":25.1942446,"longitude":55.2801487,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Mon Reve by Credo is a 17-storey residential building by Credo Investments FZE in the vibrant Downtown Dubai neighborhood.</p><p>Mon Reve by Credo offers spacious premium apartments. The building has high quality finishes, high ceilings, floor to ceiling windows. There is a choice of <strong>1-3 bedroom apartments,</strong> as well as duplex apartments with mall views. Some rooms also have large terraces.</p><p>A variety of amenities are provided for residents, including a large swimming pool, children's playground, separate gyms for men and women, and a tennis court. There is basement parking, and to ensure maximum security measures, the management of Mon Reve by Credo provides 24-hour security with CCTV cameras and maintenance services. A concierge is available 24 hours a day in the lobby of the building.</p><p>The building is located in close proximity to Dubai Mall and the iconic Burj Khalifa skyscraper. It is close to Dubai Fountain Street and Al Asayel Street. There are various schools and daycare centers, stores and restaurants nearby, including the famous P.F. Chang's and The Cheesecake Factory. Dubai International Airport (DXB) is approximately 17 minutes' drive away and Al Maktoum International Airport is approximately 44 minutes' drive away.</p>","